KG42.register("clusters-a9ce0b6c22f9557f017b7e11",{"id":"05-double_auction::v142-d-CL003","paper":"05-double_auction","label":"Welfare objective and efficiency classification of discriminatory k-DA","record":{"cluster_id":"v142-d-CL003","label":"Welfare objective and efficiency classification of discriminatory k-DA","market_meaning":"Retains the source text's qualitative descriptions of M01 economic efficiency and the social welfare objective; the existing chain cannot yet provide a solvable welfare-maximizing clearing rule.","mechanism_ids":["v141-a-M01"],"market_types":["LEM"],"process_stages":["clearing"],"scope_disposition":"unresolved","scope_explanation":"R004 uses both mechanism-property classifications and objective language; it remains undetermined whether not excluding participants is a hard constraint or an explanation of efficiency, and it cannot be equated with the evaluation metrics in Table 3.","assembly_status":"partial","boundary_rationale":"The welfare objective has independent evaluative significance. The existing sources do not connect it specifically to the allocation algorithm in R003, so it is retained as a single-chain candidate rather than assembled into an optimization model merely because both concern clearing.","chain_bindings":[{"chain_id":"v141-c-R004","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Retains the only existing chain for the M01 welfare objective and efficiency classification."}],"connections":[],"object_mappings":[],"gaps":[{"gap_id":"v142-d-CL003-G01","category":"math_incomplete","description":"Utility terms, allocation decisions, a feasible region, and an objective function are missing; the correspondence between the existing welfare-node definition and the qualitative property statement remains unclear. The transaction proportion in Table 3 is not a sum-of-utilities objective.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R004"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R004::V::clearing.social_welfare","v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-ev-09","v141-b-g01-ev-10","v141-b-g01-ev-11","v141-b-g01-ev-12"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"C is to clarify the boundaries among properties, objectives, and evaluation metrics; if an optimization rule is needed, obtain the objective and feasibility conditions for the same mechanism, without borrowing welfare statements from other mechanisms to fill the gaps."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-CL003-G02","category":"unverified_source","description":"Both the economic-efficiency definition and the classification in Table 2 are unreviewed candidate evidence.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R004"],"object_refs":[],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-ev-09","v141-b-g01-ev-10"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Verify the original statements of mechanism properties and their scope of applicability to actual strategic trading outcomes."}]},"rule_refs":["05-double_auction::v141-c-R004"],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"node_ids":["COMP-cd47922f7426cbed"]});
